      "message": "I think you should document all your unions. This one is a little strange to me though. Posix readdir returns NULL at the end, not a separate type. On the other hand, the existing interface to the storage server allows multiple files to be returned in a single call, and also keeps the state in the client so there are benefits in having a helper library on top of the ipc interface that provides the more posix like interface instead of requiring a round trip to the server for each file.",
